  "description": "🎨Design by Mako\n\n👕 Product Features:\n\nComfortable unisex fit (size up for an oversized look)\n\nPre-shrunk and long-lasting print\n\nDurable\n\nSolid colors are made from 100% ring-spun cotton; Sport Grey is 90% ring-spun cotton, 10% polyester; Heather colors are 35% cotton, 65% polyester; Graphite Heather is 65% cotton, 35% polyester.\n\n🎁 Perfect for:\n✔ Summer vacations\n✔ Beach days and sunsets\n✔ Cruise wear\n✔ Casual daywear\n✔ Birthday gifts\n\n💦 Instructions:\n\nMachine wash in cold water (recommended)\n\nTumble dry on low heat\n\nDo not bleach\n\nIron inside out if necessary\n\nDo not dry clean\n\n🚚 Return Information:\nEvery shirt is made to order just for you, which helps us reduce waste and stay sustainable . Therefore, we cannot accept returns or exchanges due to size or color selection, so please check the size chart carefully before ordering.\n\nHowever, if there is any problem or defect, message us with a photo within 30 days and we will exchange it for free...\n\n👇\nVisit my page to send me your designs and get in touch regarding custom print designs. Alternatively, we can collaborate to create a design tailored to your specific requests and needs. The custom print designs I create will be free of charge.",
